# Keep the CRM out of search engines.
#
# The strongest layer, because Google and Bing honour X-Robots-Tag without
# parsing the HTML at all — which matters here: this is a single-page app, so
# a crawler fetching / gets the shell (title, root div) before any Supabase
# session check has run. Auth hides the DATA; it does nothing about indexing
# the shell.
#
# Cloudflare Workers static assets serves this file's rules; Vite copies
# everything in public/ into dist/ verbatim.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
